# Every docked screen at Lave, from the start of a game: the status screen it opens on, then F3 to F5, Esc and F6,
# the docked host's keys (D96). Both charts move their cursor by a click (D111); the equipment screen buys a missile.
# F2 opens the market, D01, which its known answers and its golden image test instead.
wait 3
key space; wait 4                  # any key: the credits, then the status screen
